'''PΑC Omonia 29M''' ([[Greek language|Greek]]: ΑΛΣ Ομόνοια 29Μ; Αθλητικό Λαϊκό Σωματείο Ομόνοια 29ης Μαΐου; People's Athletic Club Omonia 29 May), commonly known as '''PAC Omonia''', '''ALS Omonia''' or '''Omonia 29M''', is a [[Cyprus|Cypriot]] professional [[association football|football]] club based in [[Nicosia]].

PAC Omonia 29M was formed on 29 May 2018 by the [[Gate 9]], [[AC Omonia]]'s ultras, due to a disagreement regarding the ownership of the club. They currently play in the [[Cypriot First Division]]."}}
